Z||000007||sqoach||08-17-2001||09:53 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DXR_DAD:<BR><B>Glad you made it home!!!!! It was nice to meet you and your family. Next time your out this way we'll hang a little more??? So I can show you some of my Rods!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>  <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=99075&a=723603&p=18231081&Sequence=3&res=high">  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=99075&a=723600&p=18365636&Sequence=2&res=high">  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=99075&a=723600&p=18230214&Sequence=1&res=high">  <P>DXR_DAD</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Sure! If we take a trip there again, we'll stay more in one area, instead of driving around so much. We even drove all night once and didn't sleep. I was so tired  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_zz.gif"><BR>BTW, nice cars!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
